# rgpot-local additions to Potentials.capnp, applied in this order to the
# vendored copy (the pinned potentials-schema file) to give the schema rgpot
# compiles, installs and serves. Each diff may only add lines, and every
# ordinal it adds is a local entry in CppCore/rgpot/rpc/Potentials.ordinals.
# A new local field goes in a new diff appended here; see schema_ledger.py.
# rgpot-core/schema/local mirrors this directory byte for byte for the crate.
#
# neighbour-chunk.diff: ForceInput.neighbors @9,
# PotentialResult.neighborList @28, Potential.neighbours @13 and the
# NeighborRequest, NeighborSystem and NeighborList structs. Upstream has
# none of these yet.
neighbour-chunk.diff
#
# uma-cache-dir.diff: UmaParams.cacheDir @10, the root of the persistent
# cache a UMA .pt2 is unpacked into.
uma-cache-dir.diff
#
# hessian-vector.diff: Capabilities.Operation.hessianVector @10 and
# Potential.calculateHvp @14.
hessian-vector.diff
#
# composite.diff: PotentialConfig.composite @18 and the CompositeParams and
# CompositeTerm structs, a weighted sum of PotentialSpec children that
# rgpot::SumPot evaluates.
composite.diff
#
# d2.diff: PotentialConfig.d2 @19 and the D2Params struct, the Grimme
# 2006 lattice sum rgpot::D2Pot evaluates.
d2.diff
#
# d2cpmd.diff: PotentialConfig.d2cpmd @20 and the D2CpmdParams struct,
# the minimum-image empirical D2 of OpenCPMD that rgpot::D2CpmdPot
# reproduces.
d2cpmd.diff
#
# d4-periodic.diff: D4Params.periodic @3, which passes the box to dftd4
# as a 3D lattice so rgpot::D4Pot returns the stress.
d4-periodic.diff
